{"4924800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axion Racer", "steam_appid": 4924800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrill-seekers and speed demons, wait no longer and dive into the universe of AXION RACER! Take part in ultra-fast futuristic races against a grid of fierce opponents across a dozen varied environments, including deserts, lush forests, and neon cities where loopings, barrel rolls, and high-flying jumps await. Powered by an advanced physics engine, boost, drift, and slam into your rivals to emerge victorious. Unapologetically arcade, you will be thrown into insane races reaching speeds of up to 2,000 km/h! Are you ready?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BECOME A TRUE AXION RACER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your Boost</strong> – The key to winning on the track: Boost, Cool down, Win 🏆!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master 3 difficulty levels</strong> – Prove your skills across 3 speed classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 original tracks</strong> – Race through a variety of unique environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 championships</strong> – Conquer them all and become the ultimate <i>AXION RACER</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 unique ship models</strong> – Each with its own distinct handling style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/5ef3297cbcee8041008167f638d3b976.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/5ef3297cbcee8041008167f638d3b976.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/5ef3297cbcee8041008167f638d3b976.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The BOOST button allows you to reach phenomenal speeds up to 2,000 km/h in real speed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=800 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3d136d4038c70e938cc2f31fcef6d54a.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3d136d4038c70e938cc2f31fcef6d54a.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3d136d4038c70e938cc2f31fcef6d54a.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Even in mid-flight, your ship's physics allow you to smoothly use airbrakes and steering to glide and land on the runway.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=800 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/f1bcad76434b281062c06c3f4567a9eb.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/f1bcad76434b281062c06c3f4567a9eb.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/f1bcad76434b281062c06c3f4567a9eb.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collisions damage your ship, the repair bonus allows you to reduce this damage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=800 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3a46fdcf045a59a4d178c024573b0d55.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3a46fdcf045a59a4d178c024573b0d55.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3a46fdcf045a59a4d178c024573b0d55.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Keep an eye on your boost gauge ! Excessive overheating drains your health bar... and that could prove fatal !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=800 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\